@startuml
title Adaptive default：Academic Pipeline route
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "Host Agent / Navigate" as Agent
participant "ResearchSpec CLI" as CLI
participant "academic-pipeline" as Pipeline
database "Workspace" as Files

Agent -> CLI : status
Agent -> CLI : instructions subflow:tpl-academic-pipeline-end-to-end\nor subflow:tpl-academic-pipeline-mid-entry
CLI --> Agent : route obligations, formal policies, completion criterion
Agent -> User : route summary, risk and cost
User --> Agent : confirm route
Agent -> CLI : Start
CLI -> Files : adaptive-start receipt + obligations

loop current allowed obligation
  Agent -> CLI : instructions obligation:<instance>/<id>
  Agent -> Pipeline : produce bounded research/paper/review material
  Pipeline -> Files : candidate evidence
  Agent -> CLI : accept evidence or record attempt
end

opt formal Gate or case action
  Agent -> CLI : current gate: or case-action: instructions
  Agent -> User : Verify verdict or resolution choice
end
Agent -> CLI : advance completion:<instance>/<id>
note right of CLI
  No stage graph, child dispatch,
  revision-round template or Passport import.
  Soft playbook recommends; hard dependencies constrain.
end note
@enduml
